Derivation
----------
The destructive install path (rntech-install.sh) is a derivative work of:

    bin456789/reinstall  (GPLv3)
    https://github.com/bin456789/reinstall

It is used against a self-hosted, reviewed fork. The whole config home
(helper scripts, windows.xml answer file, *.bat) is served from our fork at
runtime (see reinstall.sh `confhome`), not from the upstream repository.

    Upstream project : bin456789/reinstall
    Self-host base   : https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rnotebot/rnoteinstaller/main

